# INVWINEH.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a list a page
# and more longer than a choice of all holds (KS_MAXROWS of
# SRC/CLIENT/KEYSET.H), the seed's three items and the 4117 of
# INVWIN_WINSEEDEH.  CTRL-/ is refused as in INVWINEF, but here the walk
# stops at its first wait after the set refused a key, short of the
# list's end: the help panel, under the box, counts no row past that
# page, and the list keeps the 4120 it had counted, its focus row alone
# chosen.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEH.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH
S OVER
K ENTER
S OVERBK
K ALT-F X
